{
    "title": "Home AI: AI Interior Design",
    "description": "Home AI Design uses artificial intelligence (AI) transformation to reimagine and transform your home, enhancing your home design experience!\r\n       Simply upload a photo of your room and Home AI Design will work its magic, giving you personalized style changes based on your preferences and chosen room type, whether you're renovating an existing room, planning a new home, or are on a budget Decorating, Home AI Design can provide you with everything you need to transform your space.\r\n\r\nAI Design Features:\r\n1. Instant room makeover and redecoration\r\n      uploading room photos and selecting the decoration style and room type, your AI design will be generated immediately.\r\n2. Various space types\r\n      living room, bedroom, kitchen, office space, bathroom, restaurant, cafe, study room, restaurant, game room, attic, toilet, etc.\r\n3. Various design styles\r\n     We have over 20 different interior design styles ranging from modern interiors to traditional styles and more, explore design options customized to your liking.\r\n4. Save and share easily\r\n     Save your designs and share your design inspiration with friends and family.\r\n5. Save money and time\r\n     No need for expensive design fees,easily design more rooms.\r\n6. Suitable for target groups\r\n      Whether you are a home decoration designer or a user who knows nothing about design, Home AI Design can easily help you design your space.\r\n\r\n      Download Home AI Design now and start designing your ideal home!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Home AI Design uses artificial intelligence (AI) transformation to reimagine and transform your home, enhancing your home design experience!<br>       Simply upload a photo of your room and Home AI Design will work its magic, giving you personalized style changes based on your preferences and chosen room type, whether you&#39;re renovating an existing room, planning a new home, or are on a budget Decorating, Home AI Design can provide you with everything you need to transform your space.<br><br>AI Design Features:<br>1. Instant room makeover and redecoration<br>      uploading room photos and selecting the decoration style and room type, your AI design will be generated immediately.<br>2. Various space types<br>      living room, bedroom, kitchen, office space, bathroom, restaurant, cafe, study room, restaurant, game room, attic, toilet, etc.<br>3. Various design styles<br>     We have over 20 different interior design styles ranging from modern interiors to traditional styles and more, explore design options customized to your liking.<br>4. Save and share easily<br>     Save your designs and share your design inspiration with friends and family.<br>5. Save money and time<br>     No need for expensive design fees,easily design more rooms.<br>6. Suitable for target groups<br>      Whether you are a home decoration designer or a user who knows nothing about design, Home AI Design can easily help you design your space.<br><br>      Download Home AI Design now and start designing your ideal home!",
